om/v/t64.5771-25/673525341_1470569434846999_9047796603767135432_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ls5tDxlvM00Q7kNvwGyOaxP&_nc_oc=AdosX4Jy7L7jw6PpEwkZtgHgPB6Dq7jHaLJfjNDcVkKm53MKa45o4zpbC7CC--LZhSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKlxArEz_Y-kZvEbl8SS2at-M2xdG8x0JKfiItOF3i53w&oe=6AA2A9ED"}, {"file_name": "New Project (12).png", "id": "4552468634971326", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298427_4552468638304659_5587946098689484485_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GWm9SsmXBxMQ7kNvwHnLYqD&_nc_oc=Adr18l8CtApHaMnTbeiMPS_Q-Tj-72ign_iAuSeVYEC3ME3G-F0eqEhFcBLwmCC2ySo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKS5SAVhviXLSE5QEgsfF9lorFYkXhv0qOO3x1zOTlvdQ&oe=6AA2C461"}, {"file_name": "New Project (13).png", "id": "4368607426741505", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618937_4368607430074838_4628788917118044437_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v7Ntz3bemNQQ7kNvwE0XGtK&_nc_oc=AdqCcgyFURn4jW5nD6wnC-ZPdbTj2Z-uwqR2ZPB7ueeEc3D_wTCvmD0R6FUdSTCU-Pw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK2vflWQYx_PMz2lER-J6b_RW7Lz6OaBDyaTeJGanWS9A&oe=6AA2A392"}, {"file_name": "New Project (14).png", "id": "4363875030495206", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622325_4363875033828539_4687065373772420528_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IEmHUeHGdzYQ7kNvwEqCQWH&_nc_oc=AdrIAp068DdVo-yH8B4eynC0UElXMMgrqSlHqsQY8LcAyhgEiNl_CVF7Ifv7Jp_xlIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZg75A85noLCSHw9_yvzS1-GjbMJM8BLUPSyU0x0hH8Q&oe=6AA2BDE4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "New Project (5).png", "id": "1726734665364294", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_1726734668697627_8100232601296673505_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDKDuZhEse0Q7kNvwFVLeIC&_nc_oc=AdpRnpDJfzdfaxQKExMm91Pku10owya5Tq-5srWxGmS4_0Og7mwFxc6F2gw2pnMOplw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJDD8A570tAuCyh2mNVm9jo-cRBCcZXu117D5IDrQZ0UQ&oe=6AA2CB36"}, "display_name": "My MR Puppy", "keywords": ["pet", "dog", "puppy", "simulator", "MR"], "long_description": "My MR Puppy brings a lovable virtual dog into your real room with the magic of Mixed Reality.\n\nMeet your new playful companion, place its bed and food bowl, call it over, pet it with your hands, feed it treats, play fetch, and watch it explore your space like it truly lives there. Your puppy can walk around the room, bark, sit, sleep, react to your touch, follow you, get excited, and perform simple tricks with realistic dog animations and cute sound effects.\n\nDesigned as a cozy and relaxing MR pet experience, My MR Puppy focuses on simple daily moments that feel personal and heartwarming. Watch your dog roam across the real floor, rest in its bed, respond to commands, chase toys, and show affection when you interact with it.\n\nWhether you want a calm companion, a playful puppy, or a fun Mixed Reality experience to share with friends and family, My MR Puppy turns your home into a warm virtual pet space.\n\nFeatures:\n\nA virtual puppy that lives inside your real room\nMixed Reality room-aware placement and movement\nPetting, feeding, calling, fetch, sleeping, and tricks\nDog name selection\nFood bowl and bed placement\nRealistic dog animations\nCute bark, pant, happy, and petting sound effects\nHeart effects and emotional reactions\nSimple command menu\nPlayful activities and cozy daily interactions\nA relaxing pet experience for all ages", "short_description": "My MR Puppy is a cozy Mixed Reality pet simulator where a playful virtual dog lives inside your real room. Pet, feed, call, play fetch, place its bed and food bowl, teach simple tricks, and watch your puppy explore, bark, sleep, and react to you with realistic animations and heartwarming behavior."}]}, "developer_name": null, "d